# Language statistics
#
# GitHub reported this repository as 80% G-code because of a single 3 MB
# sliced print file, and inflated JavaScript with a vendored library. Both are
# artefacts rather than project source, so they are excluded from the language
# breakdown. The reported languages then reflect what is actually written here.
hardware/esp32_case/*.gcode  linguist-generated=true
web/vendor/**                linguist-vendored=true
docs/figures/**              linguist-documentation=true

# Binary and generated files: never apply end-of-line conversion or attempt a
# textual diff.
*.gcode  -text
*.blend  binary
*.blend1 binary
*.stl    binary
*.pptx   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.pt     binary
*.prg    binary
*.iq     binary
